+-- =====================================================================
+-- 4. PRIVILEGE SETUP FOR SECURITY-SCHEMA FUNCTIONS
+--    Revoke from PUBLIC (covers anon). Grant to authenticated only.
+--    PostgREST only exposes public schema; security schema is not an
