+From 7dca3e4f94d956b923d844dfa3ef0a4bcbbc45ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Darshil Parmar <darshilparmar@Mac.lan>
+Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:51:41 +0530
+Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat(integration): mount Context Engine Research QA
+ proxy, panel, tests, and env vars
+
+Integration components for Saneel & Parth handoff:
+- Server-side proxy route: /api/employer/research-qa (Supabase auth + org membership)
+- ResearchQAPanel.jsx: citation inspector with mandatory public research disclaimer
+- Brief page mount + dedicated /research route behind feature flag
+- 10 Vitest unit tests (6 API + 4 component), all passing
+- .env.example updated with WORKBYLINE_ENGINE_URL, WORKBYLINE_INTERNAL_SERVICE_KEY,
+  WORKBYLINE_RESEARCH_WORKSPACE_ID, NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_RESEARCH_QA
+- Feature flag disabled by default (NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_RESEARCH_QA=false)
+- CAREERTWIN_DRY_RUN_EMAIL=true preserved
