++- **No Gemini key / missing provider:** HTTP 503 `BLOCKED_PENDING_KEY_ROTATION` (mock responses purged from normal route)
++- **Malformed upstream response / object answer:** HTTP 502 `UPSTREAM_ENGINE_MALFORMED`
++- **GROUNDED status without citations:** Automatically downgraded to `INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE`
